    {
      "_id": "whbBtcSpray00001",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp",
      "name": "肉钩喷焰",
      "sort": 600000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": {
          "value": "action"
        },
        "actions": {
          "value": 2
        },
        "category": "offensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>要求</strong> 处于燃烧状态（未被熄灭）</p>\n<p>肉钩甩出一片火舌，覆盖 @Template[type:cone|distance:15]{15 尺锥形}。区内每个生物受到 @Damage[4d6[fire]] 火焰伤害，并尝试 @Check[reflex|basic|dc:22|traits:fire]{基础反射豁免 DC 22}。失败则获得 @UUID[Compendium.wang-pf2e-homebrew.homebrew-items.Item.whbHuntBurnFx001]{猎杀灼烬} 1 层（已有则 +1），并点燃场地：该生物空间及邻接一格视为短暂火场（进入或在其中开始回合受 @Damage[1d6[fire]]，持续 1 分钟或被扑灭）。</p>\n<p><em>熄火状态：</em>不能使用。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — Boss",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
        "rules": [],
        "slug": null,
        "traits": {
          "value": [
            "fire"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "whbBtcAura000001",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
      "name": "自燃躯壳",
      "sort": 500000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": {
          "value": "passive"
        },
        "actions": {
          "value": null
        },
        "category": "offensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>要求</strong> 燃烧状态</p>\n<p>屠夫本身在燃烧：对火焰伤害<strong>免疫</strong>（灯笼、喷火、火把等无效）。5 尺内生物在其回合开始时受到 @Damage[1d4[fire]]（可反映巢穴被逐步点燃）。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — Boss",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
