    {
      "_id": "whbBtcRageHead01",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/FreeAction.webp",
      "name": "第三狂怒（断头）",
      "sort": 700000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": {
          "value": "free"
        },
        "actions": {
          "value": null
        },
        "category": "offensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>触发</strong> 首次降至最大 HP 的 1/4 以下（约 75% 血已耗尽）；或由 GM 手动激活</p>\n<p><strong>效果</strong> 猪头脱落仍战斗。施加（可随时开关）@UUID[Compendium.wang-pf2e-homebrew.homebrew-items.Item.whbHuntBtcHdFx01]{效果：屠夫断头}。</p>\n<p>若尚未狂暴，建议同时施加 @UUID[Compendium.wang-pf2e-homebrew.homebrew-items.Item.whbHuntBtcRgFx01]{效果：屠夫狂暴}。断头效果会把物理抗性提到 12，并再加速、再加命中；燃烧时光环改为 10 尺 1d6（口述）。</p>"
        },
